
Creates a new instance and sets the property values for the new instance.
USAGE:

CREATE <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

NOTE: Create cannot be used to create a new class.

The following properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
AudibleAlarm                       	N/A                 	N/A       
BreachDescription                  	N/A                 	N/A       
CableManagementStrategy            	N/A                 	N/A       
ChassisTypes                       	N/A                 	N/A       
CurrentRequiredOrProduced          	N/A                 	N/A       
Depth                              	N/A                 	N/A       
Description                        	N/A                 	N/A       
HeatGeneration                     	N/A                 	N/A       
Height                             	N/A                 	N/A       
HotSwappable                       	N/A                 	N/A       
InstallDate                        	N/A                 	N/A       
LockPresent                        	N/A                 	N/A       
Manufacturer                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Model                              	N/A                 	N/A       
Name                               	N/A                 	N/A       
NumberOfPowerCords                 	N/A                 	N/A       
OtherIdentifyingInfo               	N/A                 	N/A       
PartNumber                         	N/A                 	N/A       
PoweredOn                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Removable                          	N/A                 	N/A       
Replaceable                        	N/A                 	N/A       
SKU                                	N/A                 	N/A       
SMBIOSAssetTag                     	N/A                 	N/A       
SecurityBreach                     	N/A                 	N/A       
SecurityStatus                     	N/A                 	N/A       
SerialNumber                       	N/A                 	N/A       
ServiceDescriptions                	N/A                 	N/A       
ServicePhilosophy                  	N/A                 	N/A       
Status                             	N/A                 	N/A       
Tag                                	N/A                 	N/A       
TypeDescriptions                   	N/A                 	N/A       
Version                            	N/A                 	N/A       
VisibleAlarm                       	N/A                 	N/A       
Weight                             	N/A                 	N/A       
Width                              	N/A                 	N/A       

